82,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-01T21:19:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T06:20:15Z","closed_at":"2025-08-06T06:20:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109193\r\n\r\nThis is one option for fixing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109193. \r\n\r\nThe core of the issue is twofold:\r\n1. When doing code completion for an object that is the return value of a function, GDScript will actually call the function if it is `const` so it can do code completion on for that object\r\n2. `RenderingServer.create_local_rendering_device()` is marked as const. And is technically const, but it does allocate a bunch of CPU and GPU resources and is not ref counted so it never gets freed\r\n\r\nI opted to solve the issue by removing `const` from `create_local_rendering_device()` since it doesn't really need it.\r\n\r\nI am worried that this will break compatibility for GDExtensions. If it does, and we can't accept the breakage, then perhaps there is a way for us to modify code complete to cache the return values of functions that it calls so we don't endlessly leak memory.\r\n\r\nCC @HolonProduction ","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109211/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}